UNISIM-II-D reservoir model

Files:
    UNISIM-II-D.zip
    UNISIM-II-D.vtu

Source: UNISIM-CEPETRO-Unicamp
URL: https://www.unisim.cepetro.unicamp.br/benchmarks/br/unisim-ii/overview

Redistributed from: https://github.com/pyvista/pyvista-support/issues/319#issuecomment-821725156
UNISIM-II-D.zip is the attachment posted there by Rodrigo Mologni, who
converted the UNISIM-II-D corner-point grid to a VTK unstructured grid.
UNISIM-II-D.vtu is the same grid with the conversion field data and the
vtkOriginalCellIds array removed, no active scalars, and the K index reversed
to increase upward, with each hexahedron's node order flipped to match so that
the cells have positive volume.

